{# Chain-of-Density: Iterative summarization with density #}
{% set iteration = iteration|default(1) %}
{% set max_iterations = max_iterations|default(3) %}
{% set compression_ratio = compression_ratio|default(20) %}

{% if iteration == 1 %}
Summarize concisely. Iteration 1/{{ max_iterations }}.

{% elif iteration == 2 %}
More dense. Remove filler, add specifics.
Previous: {{ previous_summary }}
Iteration 2/{{ max_iterations }}.

{% else %}
Maximum density. Every word carries facts.
Previous: {{ previous_summary }}
Iteration {{ iteration }}/{{ max_iterations }} (final).
{% endif %}

Query: {{ user_input }}

Each version must:
1. Retain ALL key facts from the prior version
2. Reduce token count by ~{{ compression_ratio }}%
3. Maintain clarity and answer completeness
